ns can be bought in the store, which is in each dungeon, but they need to be found.<br><br>Also, your character has a permanent progression. Before the new descent into the dungeon you will get to the character upgrade menu.<br>Unlike potions, upgrades remains forever, even after the death of your character.<br><br>How deep can you descent to the dungeons?",
